==Strategy==
"Critical" Rate UP [[Cat Combo|Combos]] such as [[Whale Digger (Combo)|Whale Digger]] are recommended, alongside 3 or more meatshields like [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]], [[Li'l Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Cat]] and [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cat]]. Critical attackers such as [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]] and [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] are very helpful against the Metal Hippoes. Once the Metal Hippoes are all defeated, only occasional Metal Doges and Croconators will spawn, leaving lots of time to defeat Teacher Cybear. Alternatively, Talented [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]] can be used to create wave attacks on the Metal Hippoes that wear down the Teacher Cybear over time (be aware that this will take a while, as Teacher Cybear takes 50 hits to defeat).

==Trivia==
*This is the only stage besides its [[Forged to Kill (Deadly)|debut stage]] where Teacher Cybear is present.

